{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_02c7799163af43cfaf787e8e52433dca","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No nodeId was provided. Listing the top-level pages of the document. Call get_metadata again with one of the page ids below (or any node id underneath) to get the XML metadata for that subtree.\n\nTop-level pages of the document:\n- 0:1: 00 · Start Here 设计任务\n- 1:2: 01 · Foundations 视觉规范\n- 1:3: 02 · Components 组件库\n- 1:4: 04 · Media 素材库\n- 8:2: 03 · Workspace"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4452011-3230-4699-83de-3ef384270e2a","uuid":"5f2b6a1f-9a98-4be7-9b96-4a715d9b3235","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:11:29.109Z","tool_use_result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"No nodeId was provided. Listing the top-level pages of the document. Call get_metadata again with one of the page ids below (or any node id underneath) to get the XML metadata for that subtree.\n\nTop-level pages of the document:\n- 0:1: 00 · Start Here 设计任务\n- 1:2: 01 · Foundations 视觉规范\n- 1:3: 02 · Components 组件库\n- 1:4: 04 · Media 素材库\n- 8:2: 03 · Workspace"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"ca7bf3aa-7d10-4734-bb42-684316548149"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_02c7799163af43cfaf787e8e52433dca","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610312011297374387278268d9d65qivlXyT","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_a0bb085bffda4c888705a7a33bfbbb88","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  const pages = figma.root.children;\n  const result = {};\n\n  for (const page of pages) {\n    await page.loadAsync();\n    \n    function extractText(node) {\n      let texts = [];\n      if (node.type === 'TEXT') {\n        texts.push({ name: node.name, characters: node.characters });\n      }\n      if ('children' in node) {\n        for (const child of node.children) {\n          texts.push(...extractText(child));\n        }\n      }\n      return texts;\n    }\n\n    function summarizeNode(node) {\n      return {\n        id: node.id,\n        name: node.name,\n        type: node.type,\n        childrenCount: 'children' in node ? node.children.length : 0\n      };\n    }\n\n    result[page.name] = {\n      id: page.id,\n      topNodes: page.children.map(summarizeNode),\n      texts: extractText(page)\n    };\n  }\n\n  return result;\n})()","description":"Inspect page contents and read specifications across all pages","fileKey":"SWZDf6UJywe35eYKx1FOzo"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10785,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4452011-3230-4699-83de-3ef384270e2a","uuid":"8fd812fe-9178-4e67-9666-e8aa18bcf211","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:11:35.827Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_a0bb085bffda4c888705a7a33bfbbb88","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_a0bb085bffda4c888705a7a33bfbbb88","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\":{\"id\":\"0:1\",\"topNodes\":[{\"id\":\"7:2\",\"name\":\"Start Here · Brief\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"childrenCount\":7}],\"texts\":[{\"name\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\",\"characters\":\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\"},{\"name\":\"Expenio — personal expense manager\",\"characters\":\"Expenio — personal expense manager\"},{\"name\":\"Design Expenio, a personal expense manager: get started, check your balance and spending, open your wallet, add a new card, pay a friend and keep the receipt. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\",\"characters\":\"Design Expenio, a personal expense manager: get started, check your balance and spending, open your wallet, add a new card, pay a friend and keep the receipt. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\"},{\"name\":\"How to work\",\"characters\":\"How to work\"},{\"name\":\"1. Build exactly the 6 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, illustrations, card artwork, avatars, merchant and card-network marks and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\",\"characters\":\"1. Build exactly the 6 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links.\\n2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions.\\n3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently.\\n4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file.\\n5. Use the logo, illustrations, card artwork, avatars, merchant and card-network marks and icons from 04 · Media.\\n6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\"},{\"name\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\",\"characters\":\"Frames · goals · must include · links\"},{\"name\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\",\"characters\":\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\"},{\"name\":\"01_Get_Started\",\"characters\":\"01_Get_Started\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: Understand what Expenio is and start.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Understand what Expenio is and start.\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\"},{\"name\":\"• Actions: “Get Started” • App: Logo_Expenio • Copy: “Going cashless has never been easier with the world’s leading expense manager.” • Media: Illustration_Get_Started\",\"characters\":\"• Actions: “Get Started”\\n• App: Logo_Expenio\\n• Copy: “Going cashless has never been easier with the world’s leading expense manager.”\\n• Media: Illustration_Get_Started\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\"},{\"name\":\"→ Get Started → 02_Home\",\"characters\":\"→ Get Started → 02_Home\"},{\"name\":\"02_Home\",\"characters\":\"02_Home\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: See my balance, spending trend and latest transactions.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: See my balance, spending trend and latest transactions.\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\"},{\"name\":\"• Actions: open balance (Icon_Chevron_Right) · “See all” · new payment (Icon_Plus) • Balance: “My Balance” · $25,520.00 • Expenses: “Expenses” chart, MAR – AUG, JUN highlighted at $80.40 • Greeting: “Hello, Maria” · “Home” · Avatar_Maria_Lopez • Transactions: “Wallet” · 3 rows (see DATA)\",\"characters\":\"• Actions: open balance (Icon_Chevron_Right) · “See all” · new payment (Icon_Plus)\\n• Balance: “My Balance” · $25,520.00\\n• Expenses: “Expenses” chart, MAR – AUG, JUN highlighted at $80.40\\n• Greeting: “Hello, Maria” · “Home” · Avatar_Maria_Lopez\\n• Transactions: “Wallet” · 3 rows (see DATA)\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\"},{\"name\":\"→ open balance / See all → 03_Wallet → new payment → 05_Payment\",\"characters\":\"→ open balance / See all → 03_Wallet\\n→ new payment → 05_Payment\"},{\"name\":\"03_Wallet\",\"characters\":\"03_Wallet\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: Review my card, an offer and my transactions.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Review my card, an offer and my transactions.\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\"},{\"name\":\"• Actions: “Back” (Icon_Back) · add card (Icon_Add_Card) • Card: Maria’s Visa card (see DATA) · card 1 of 3 in the wallet • Header: “Wallet” • Promo: “POPULAR” · “Get up to 15% cashback on clothing and apparel” (Promo_Cashback) • Transactions: “Transactions” · 3 rows (see DATA)\",\"characters\":\"• Actions: “Back” (Icon_Back) · add card (Icon_Add_Card)\\n• Card: Maria’s Visa card (see DATA) · card 1 of 3 in the wallet\\n• Header: “Wallet”\\n• Promo: “POPULAR” · “Get up to 15% cashback on clothing and apparel” (Promo_Cashback)\\n• Transactions: “Transactions” · 3 rows (see DATA)\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\"},{\"name\":\"→ Back → 02_Home → add card → 04_Add_Card\",\"characters\":\"→ Back → 02_Home\\n→ add card → 04_Add_Card\"},{\"name\":\"04_Add_Card\",\"characters\":\"04_Add_Card\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: Add a new payment card.\",\"characters\":\"Goal: Add a new payment card.\"},{\"name\":\"MUST INCLUDE\",\"characters\":\"MUST INCLUDE\"},{\"name\":\"• Actions: close (Icon_Close) · “Add new card” • Card preview: shows the number typed so far (see DATA, Logo_Mastercard); name and expiry not yet entered • Form: “Card holder’s name” (empty, placeholder “Name on card”) · “Card number” 5412 7534 0089 2216, focused, Mastercard detected (Logo_Mastercard) · “Expiry Date” (empty, placeholder “MM / YY”) · “CVV” (empty, placeholder “123”, help Icon_Help) • Header: “Add new card” • Presentation: sheet over 03_Wallet\",\"characters\":\"• Actions: close (Icon_Close) · “Add new card”\\n• Card preview: shows the number typed so far (see DATA, Logo_Mastercard); name and expiry not yet entered\\n• Form: “Card holder’s name” (empty, placeholder “Name on card”) · “Card number” 5412 7534 0089 2216, focused, Mastercard detected (Logo_Mastercard) · “Expiry Date” (empty, placeholder “MM / YY”) · “CVV” (empty, placeholder “123”, help Icon_Help)\\n• Header: “Add new card”\\n• Presentation: sheet over 03_Wallet\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\"},{\"name\":\"→ Add new card / close → 03_Wallet\",\"characters\":\"→ Add new card / close → 03_Wallet\"},{\"name\":\"05_Payment\",\"characters\":\"05_Payment\"},{\"name\":\"Goal: Pay Robert $50.00 with my card.\",\"characters\