e or See all → 03_Wallet; new payment → 05_Payment → Pay now → 06_Receipt → Home → 02_Home.\\n• 04_Add_Card is a sheet over 03_Wallet. There is no tab bar in this task.\\n• Entry only (no frame): transaction rows, chart points, the promo, other cards in the wallet, share, typing a note.\"},{\"name\":\"Fixed data & copy\",\"characters\":\"Fixed data & copy\"},{\"name\":\"Use these values verbatim.\",\"characters\":\"Use these values verbatim.\"},{\"name\":\"User\",\"characters\":\"User\"},{\"name\":\"Maria Lopez · Avatar_Maria_Lopez\",\"characters\":\"Maria Lopez · Avatar_Maria_Lopez\"},{\"name\":\"Balance\",\"characters\":\"Balance\"},{\"name\":\"My Balance $25,520.00 (the same balance printed on Maria’s card)\",\"characters\":\"My Balance $25,520.00 (the same balance printed on Maria’s card)\"},{\"name\":\"Expenses chart\",\"characters\":\"Expenses chart\"},{\"name\":\"Months MAR · APR · MAY · JUN · JUL · AUG Highlighted point: JUN · $80.40 (the curve shape of other months is illustrative)\",\"characters\":\"Months MAR · APR · MAY · JUN · JUL · AUG\\nHighlighted point: JUN · $80.40 (the curve shape of other months is illustrative)\"},{\"name\":\"Transactions (newest first)\",\"characters\":\"Transactions (newest first)\"},{\"name\":\"Nike Air Max 2090 · 15 Aug 2020 · −$243.00 (Merchant_Nike) iPad Pro 2020 · 10 Aug 2020 · −$799.00 (Merchant_Apple) Uber · 5 Mar 2020 · +$50.00 (Merchant_Uber)\",\"characters\":\"Nike Air Max 2090 · 15 Aug 2020 · −$243.00 (Merchant_Nike)\\niPad Pro 2020 · 10 Aug 2020 · −$799.00 (Merchant_Apple)\\nUber · 5 Mar 2020 · +$50.00 (Merchant_Uber)\"},{\"name\":\"Maria’s card\",\"characters\":\"Maria’s card\"},{\"name\":\"Visa (Logo_Visa) · BALANCE $25,520.00 4225 9765 0008 6141 · MARIA LOPEZ · EXPIRY 09/24 Artwork: Card_Texture_Coral\",\"characters\":\"Visa (Logo_Visa) · BALANCE $25,520.00\\n4225 9765 0008 6141 · MARIA LOPEZ · EXPIRY 09/24\\nArtwork: Card_Texture_Coral\"},{\"name\":\"New card (04)\",\"characters\":\"New card (04)\"},{\"name\":\