ome” • Header: “Receipt” • Receipt: “CASH RECEIPT” · 20.08.2020 · Amount · Service Fee · Internet Charge · Total · barcode (Barcode_Receipt) (see DATA)\",\"characters\":\"• Actions: share (Icon_Share) · “Home”\\n• Header: “Receipt”\\n• Receipt: “CASH RECEIPT” · 20.08.2020 · Amount · Service Fee · Internet Charge · Total · barcode (Barcode_Receipt) (see DATA)\"},{\"name\":\"LINKS\",\"characters\":\"LINKS\"},{\"name\":\"→ Home → 02_Home\",\"characters\":\"→ Home → 02_Home\"},{\"name\":\"Navigation structure\",\"characters\":\"Navigation structure\"},{\"name\":\"• Flow: 01_Get_Started → Get Started → 02_Home. From 02: open balance or See all → 03_Wallet; new payment → 05_Payment → Pay now → 06_Receipt → Home → 02_Home. • 04_Add_Card is a sheet over 03_Wallet. There is no tab bar in this task. • Entry only (no frame): transaction rows, chart points, the promo, other cards in the wallet, share, typing a note.\",\"characters\":\"• Flow: 01_Get_Started → Get Started → 02_Home. From 02: open balance or See all → 03_Wallet; new payment → 05_Payment → Pay now → 06_Receipt → Home → 02_Home.\\n• 04_Add_Card is a sheet over 03_Wallet. There is no tab bar in this task.\\n• Entry only (no frame): transaction rows, chart points, the promo, other cards in the wallet, share, typing a note.\"},{\"name\":\"Fixed data & copy\",\"characters\":\"Fixed data & copy\"},{\"name\":\"Use these values verbatim.\",\"characters\":\"Use these values verbatim.\"},{\"name\":\"User\",\"characters\":\"User\"},{\"name\":\"Maria Lopez · Avatar_Maria_Lopez\",\"characters\":\"Maria Lopez · Avatar_Maria_Lopez\"},{\"name\":\"Balance\",\"characters\":\"Balance\"},{\"name\":\"My Balance $25,520.00 (the same balance printed on Maria’s card)\",\"characters\":\"My Balance $25,520.00 (the same balance printed on Maria’s card)\"},{\"name\":\"Expenses chart\",\"characters\":\"Expenses chart\"},{\"name\":\"Months MAR · APR · MAY · JUN · JUL · AUG Highlighted point: JUN · $80.40 (the curve shape of other months is illustrative)\",\"characters\":\"Months MAR · APR · MAY · JUN · JUL · AUG\\nHighlighted point: JUN · $80.40 (the curve shape of other months is illustrative)\"},{\"name\":\"Transactions (newest first)\",\"characters\":\"Transactions (newest first)\"},{\"name\":\"Nike Air Max 2090 · 15 Aug 2020 · −$243.00 (Merchant_Nike) iPad Pro 2020 · 10 Aug 2020 · −$799.00 (Merchant_Apple) Uber · 5 Mar 2020 · +$50.00 (Merchant_Uber)\",\"characters\":\"Nike Air Max 2090 · 15 Aug 2020 · −$243.00 (Merchant_Nike)\\niPad Pro 2020 · 10 Aug 2020 · −$799.00 (Merchant_Apple)\\nUber · 5 Mar 2020 · +$50.00 (Merchant_Uber)\"},{\"name\":\"Maria’s card\",\"characters\":\"Maria’s card\"},{\"name\":\"Visa (Logo_Visa) · BALANCE $25,520.00 4225 9765 0008 6141 · MARIA LOPEZ · EXPIRY 09/24 Artwork: Card_Texture_Coral\",\"characters\":\"Visa (Logo_Visa) · BALANCE $25,520.00\\n4225 9765 0008 6141 · MARIA LOPEZ · EXPIRY 09/24\\nArtwork: Card_Texture_Coral\"},{\"name\":\"New card (04)\",\"characters\":\"New card (04)\"},{\"name\":\"Mastercard (Logo_Mastercard) · 5412 7534 0089 2216 Holder name, expiry and CVV not yet entered\",\"characters\":\"Mastercard (Logo_Mastercard) · 5412 7534 0089 2216\\nHolder name, expiry and CVV not yet entered\"},{\"name\":\"Promo\",\"characters\":\"Promo\"},{\"name\":\"POPULAR · Get up to 15% cashback on clothing and apparel · Promo_Cashback\",\"characters\":\"POPULAR · Get up to 15% cashback on clothing and apparel · Promo_Cashback\"},{\"name\":\"Payment\",\"characters\":\"Payment\"},{\"name\":\"Paying Robert Dawson (Avatar_Robert_Dawson) · $50.00 · from Maria’s Visa card\",\"characters\":\"Paying Robert Dawson (Avatar_Robert_Dawson) · $50.00 · from Maria’s Visa card\"},{\"name\":\"Receipt\",\"characters\":\"Receipt\"},{\"name\":\"CASH RECEIPT · 20.08.2020 Amount $40.00 · Service Fee $2.82 · Internet Charge $7.18 Total $50.00\",\"characters\":\"CASH RECEIPT · 20.08.2020\\nAmount $40.00 · Service Fee $2.82 · Internet Charge $7.18\\nTotal $50.00\"},{\"name\":\"What is fixed · what is yours\",\"characters\":\"What is fixed · what is yours\"},{\"name\":\"Fixed (given)\",\"characters\":\"Fixed (given)\"},{\"name\":\"• Frame list and exact names • Must-include content per frame (what, not how) • Navigation structure and links • All data and copy • Brand color #007AFF and Inter • Media: logo, illustrations, card artwork, avatars, merchant and card-network marks, barcode, icons • Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\",\"characters\":\"• Frame list and exact names\\n• Must-include content per frame (what, not how)\\n• Navigation structure and links\\n• All data and copy\\n• Brand color #007AFF and Inter\\n• Media: logo, illustrations, card artwork, avatars, merchant and card-network marks, barcode, icons\\n• Default Button, default Text Field, platform shell\"},{\"name\":\"Yours (designer decides)\",\"characters\":\"Yours (designer decides)\"},{\"name\":\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen • All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces, chart, positive / negative amounts, error / disabled • Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation • All states: focused field, current card in the wallet, highlighted chart point, pressed, disabled • Headers, balance card, payment card, chart, transaction rows, promo card, sheet, receipt • How images are cropped and treated\",\"characters\":\"• Layout, grouping, order and emphasis on every screen\\n• All other colors: neutrals, text, backgrounds / surfaces, chart, positive / negative amounts, error / disabled\\n• Type scale, spacing, radii, elevation\\n• All states: focused field, current card in the wallet, highlighted chart point, pressed, disabled\\n• Headers, balance card, payment card, chart, transaction rows, promo card, sheet, receipt\\n• How images are cropped and treated\"},{\"name\":\"How it is evaluated\",\"characters\":\"How it is evaluated\"},{\"name\":\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\",\"characters\":\"Your file is compared with this brief on coverage, data and flow — not on visual similarity to any original.\"},{\"name\":\"1. Checklist coverage per frame 2. Data & copy accuracy 3. Flow & prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (focused card-number field, current card, highlighted chart point, sheet presentation)\",\"characters\":\"1. Checklist coverage per frame\\n2. Data & copy accuracy\\n3. Flow & prototype completeness\\n4. Information hierarchy\\n5. Visual quality & consistency of your own system\\n6. Component reuse\\n7. State design (focused card-number field, current card, highlighted chart point, sheet presentation)\"},{\"name\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 6 named frames, your components and the prototype.\",\"characters\":\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 6 named frames, your components and the prototype.\"}]},\"01 · Foundations 视觉规范\":{\"id\":\"1:2\",\"topNodes\":[{\"id\":\"1:5\",\"name\":\"Foundations\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"childrenCount\":8}],\"texts\":[{\"name\":\"Foundations · Expenio\",\"characters\":\"Foundations · Expenio\"},{\"name\":\"Fixed: the brand color and the typeface below. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, backgrounds and surfaces (including any tint or gradient), the payment-card artwork, chart colors, positive / negative amounts, error and disabled, type scale, spacing, radii and elevation.\",\"characters\":\"Fixed: the brand color and the typeface below. Everything else is yours to define and apply consistently: neutrals and grays, text colors, backgrounds and surfaces (including any tint or gradient), the payment-card artwork, chart colors, positive / negative amounts, error and disabled, type scale, spacing, radii and elevation.\"},{\"name\":\"Brand color\",\"characters\":\"Brand color\"},{\"name\":\"Brand primary · blue\",\"characters\":\"Brand primary · blue\"},{\"name\":\"#007AFF\",\"characters\":\"#007AFF\"},{\"name\":\"Expenio’s main brand color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\",\"characters\":\"Expenio’s main brand color. Where and how much to use it is your decision.\"},{\"name\":\"Typeface\",\"characters\":\"Typeface\"},{\"name\":\"Aa Bb Cc 0123456789 $25,520.00\",\"characters\":\"Aa Bb Cc 0123456789  $25,520.00\"},{\"name\":\"Use Inter for all UI text (it replaces the source’s SF Pro and Helvetica Neue, which are not available). Numbers printed on the payment card may use a monospaced face of your choice. Sizes, weights and line heights are yours to define as a consistent type scale.\",\"characters\":\"Use Inter for all UI text (it replaces the source’s SF Pro and Helvetica Neue, which are not available). Numbers printed on the payment card may use a monospaced face of your choice. Sizes, weights and line heights are yours to define as a consistent type scale.\"},{\"name\":\"Canvas: 375 × 812 (iPhone X / 11 Pro). Light mode only. 02_Home and 03_Wallet may scroll vertically.\",\"characters\":\"Canvas: 375 × 812 (iPhone X / 11 Pro). Light mode only. 02_Home and 03_Wallet may scroll vertically.\"}]},\"02 · Components 组件库\":{\"id\":\"1:3\",\"topNodes\":[{\"id\":\"1:19\",\"name\":\"Components\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"childrenCount\":9}],\"texts\":[{\"name\":\"Components · Expenio (default states only)\",\"characters\":\"Components · Expenio (default states only)\"},{\"name\":\"Only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell are given. Every other state (pressed, focused, filled, error, disabled, current card…), the headers, the bottom sheet and every business component (balance card, payment card, chart, transaction rows, promo card, receipt…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\",\"characters\":\"Only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell are given. Every other state (pressed, focused, filled, error, disabled, current card…), the headers, the bottom sheet and every business component (balance card, payment card, chart, transaction rows, promo card, receipt…) are part of the assignment — build them as reusable components in your own file.\"},{\"name\":\"Button · default\",\"characters\":\"Button · default\"},{\"name\":\"Get Started\",\"characters\":\"Get Started\"},{\"name\":\"Text Field · default\",\"characters\":\"Text Field · default\"},{\"name\":\"Card holder’s name\",\"characters\":\"Card holder’s name\"},{\"name\":\"Name on card\",\"characters\":\"Name on card\"},{\"name\":\"Platform shell · system UI (not evaluated)\",\"characters\":\"Platform shell · system UI (not evaluated)\"},{\"name\":\"iOS status bar (with notch) and home indicator, 375 wide, transparent background. Place them on every frame; they are not part of your design (recolor the glyphs to white on dark areas if needed).\",\"characters\":\"iOS status bar (with notch) and home indicator, 375 wide, transparent background. Place them on every frame; they are not part of your design (recolor the glyphs to white on dark areas if needed).\"},{\"name\":\"9:41\",\"characters\":\"9:41\"}]},\"04 · Media 素材库\":{\"id\":\"1:4\",\"topNodes\":[{\"id\":\"6:12\",\"name\":\"Media\",\"type\":\"FRAME\",\"childrenCount\":16}],\"texts\":[{\"name\":\"Media · Expenio\",\"characters\":\"Media · Expenio\"},{\"name\":\"Copy these components into your own file and use them as instances. Avatars are named after the person; merchant logos after the merchant. Card_Texture_Coral is the artwork of Maria’s payment card (use it, or not, as your card design needs). Icons are neutral (#1A1A1F) line icons — recolor them to fit your color system; the Mastercard and Visa marks keep their brand colors (Logo_Visa is white, shown on gray).\",\"characters\":\"Copy these components into your own file and use them as instances. Avatars are named after the person; merchant logos after the merchant. Card_Texture_Coral is the artwork of Maria’s payment card (use it, or not, as your card design needs). Icons are neutral (#1A1A1F) line icons — recolor them to fit your color system; the Mastercard and Visa marks keep their brand colors (Logo_Visa is white, shown on gray).\"},{\"name\":\"Logo\",\"characters\":\"Logo\"},{\"name\":\"Logo_Expenio\",\"characters\":\"Logo_Expenio\"},{\"name\":\"Illustrations and artwork\",\"characters\":\"Illustrations and artwork\"},{\"name\":\"Card_Texture_Coral\",\"characters\":\"Card_Texture_Coral\"},{\"name\":\"Illustration_Get_Started\",\"characters\":\"Illustration_Get_Started\"},{\"name\":\"Promo_Cashback\",\"characters\":\"Promo_Cashback\"},{\"name\":\"People\",\"characters\":\"People\"},{\"name\":\"Avatar_Maria_Lopez\",\"characters\":\"Avatar_Maria_Lopez\"},{\"name\":\"Avatar_Robert_Dawson\",\"characters\":\"Avatar_Robert_Dawson\"},{\"name\":\"Merchants\",\"characters\":\"Merchants\"},{\"name\":\"Merchant_Apple\",\"characters\":\"Merchant_Apple\"},{\"name\":\"Merchant_Nike\",\"characters\":\"Merchant_Nike\"},{\"name\":\"Merchant_Uber\",\"characters\":\"Merchant_Uber\"},{\"name\":\"Card networks\",\"characters\":\"Card networks\"},{\"name\":\"Logo_Mastercard\",\"characters\":\"Logo_Mastercard\"},{\"name\":\"Logo_Visa\",\"characters\":\"Logo_Visa\"},{\"name\":\"Receipt\",\"characters\":\"Receipt\"},{\"name\":\"Barcode_Receipt\",\"characters\":\"Barcode_Receipt\"},{\"name\":\"Icons\",\"characters\":\"Icons\"},{\"name\":\"Icon_Add_Card\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Add_Card\"},{\"name\":\"Icon_Back\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Back\"},{\"name\":\"Icon_Chevron_Right\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Chevron_Right\"},{\"name\":\"Icon_Close\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Close\"},{\"name\":\"Icon_Help\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Help\"},{\"name\":\"Icon_Plus\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Plus\"},{\"name\":\"Icon_Share\",\"characters\":\"Icon_Share\"}]},\"03 · Workspace\":{\"id\":\"8:2\",\"topNodes\":[],\"texts\":[]}}"}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"6fb65e05-7a4e-4167-869a-8dec07b9b6ef"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_a0bb085bffda4c888705a7a33bfbbb88","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610312011411271182378268d9d6rBu9S7fe","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_9cfa6ed6e476497a983725a844ce2494","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"(async () => {\n  const componentsPage = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.includes(\"02 · Components\"));\n  const mediaPage = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.includes(\"04 · Media\"));\n  const foundationsPage = figma.root.children.find(p => p.name.includes(\"01 · Foundations\"));\n\n  await componentsPage.loadAsync();\n  await mediaPage.loadAsync();\n  await foundationsPage.loadAsync();\n\n  function getDetails(node) {\n    if (node.type === 'COMPONENT' || node.type === 'COMPONENT_SET' || node.type === 'FRAME') {\n      return {\n        id: node.id,\n        name: node.name,\n        type: node.type,\n        width: node.width,\n        height: node.height,\n        children: 'children' in node ? node.children.map(c => ({ id: c.id, name: c.name, type: c.type })) : []\n      };\n    }\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  const components = componentsPage.children[0].children.map(getDetails).filter(Boolean);\n  const media = mediaPage.children[0].children.map(getDetails).filter(Boolean);\n  \n  return {\n    components,\n    media\n  };\n})()","description":"Query component and media node lists to understand available reusable elements and their IDs.","fileKey":"SWZDf6UJywe35eYKx1FOzo"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":16699,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":9992},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4452011-3230-4699-83de-3ef384270e2a","uuid":"c4423bad-5d6d-4664-9d98-f16006ae74c9","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:11:49.291Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"call_9cfa6ed6e476497a983725a844ce2494","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
