{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"chatcmpl-202610312015028281139468268d9d6rsHtqiUq","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Reasoning summary:\nThe design tasks, visual guidelines, component and media usage specifications have been loaded and completed.\n1. Built all 6 frames exactly as specified under the `03 · Workspace` page:\n   - `01_Get_Started`: Included app logo, illustration, description, and configured \"Get Started\" button.\n   - `02_Home`: Created welcome section, balance card with $25,520.00, dynamic custom-drawn expense line chart with month tags (JUN highlighted at $80.40 with tooltip), 3 transaction rows, and float plus action button.\n   - `03_Wallet`: Built navigation bar, Maria's custom Visa card, card indicator (1 of 3), custom layout cash back promotional banner with badge, and transaction list.\n   - `04_Add_Card`: Drawn interactive-ready bottom sheet over dim overlay containing Mastercard preview, inputs for Name on card, Card Number, Expiry, and CVV (including Mastercard detection badge and input focus state styling).\n   - `05_Payment`: Rendered Robert Dawson payee detail with avatar, note input, Maria's mini Visa card selection, and \"Pay now\" action.\n   - `06_Receipt`: Configured cash receipt structure displaying amounts ($40.00, $2.82, $7.18, total $50.00) alongside receipt barcode and \"Home\" back navigation.\n2. Prototype connections successfully wired:\n   - `01_Get_Started` -> Get Started button -> `02_Home`\n   - `02_Home` -> open balance (Chevron / Balance Card) OR \"See all\" -> `03_Wallet`\n   - `02_Home` -> new payment (FAB +) -> `05_Payment`\n   - `03_Wallet` -> Back icon -> `02_Home`\n   - `03_Wallet` -> add card icon -> `04_Add_Card`\n   - `04_Add_Card` -> Add new card OR close icon -> `03_Wallet`\n   - `05_Payment` -> Pay now -> `06_Receipt`\n   - `05_Payment` -> Cancel -> `02_Home`\n   - `06_Receipt` -> Home -> `02_Home`\nAll layouts conform cleanly to the 375x812 iPhone constraints utilizing the design-system components, media assets, \"Inter\" font weights and designated primary color #007AFF. Screenshots verify complete compliance.\n\nFinal answer:\n我已经成功在指定的 Figma 文件中，将所有的产品设计及交互原型交付至「03 · Workspace」页面。\n\n以下是本次交付的具体设计细节与原型连接结构：\n\n### 1. 交付页面与文件\n* **Figma 文件 URL**: [Expenio Design Bench](https://www.figma.com/design/SWZDf6UJywe35eYKx1FOzo/)\n* **交付页面**: `03 · Workspace` (Page ID: `8:2`)\n\n---\n\n### 2. 完工画板（Frames）及节点 ID\n1. **`01_Get_Started`** (Node ID: `10:2`) — 包含 Expenio 官方 Logo、引导插画、主文案，以及配置好的 \"Get Started\" 按钮。\n2. **`02_Home`** (Node ID: `10:22`) — 个人首页。包含 Maria 的欢迎头部、余额卡片（$25,520.00）、折线图表（高亮 JUN 月份及 $80.40 标签提示）、最近的 3 条交易记录，以及右下角的悬浮加号支付按钮。\n3. **`03_Wallet`** (Node ID: `10:81`) — 我的钱包。包含顶部导航条、Maria 的专属 Coral 材质 Visa 银行卡（卡 1 / 3）、带有 \"POPULAR\" 高亮标签的返现活动 Banner，以及 3 条历史卡交易明细。\n4. **`04_Add_Card`** (Node ID: `10:133`) — 以半屏抽屉（Bottom Sheet）和背景遮罩层呈现。预览卡实时显示键入的万事达卡，且包含输入聚焦态、Mastercard 商标检测、CVV 帮助图标等。\n5. **`05_Payment`** (Node ID: `10:191`) — 支付确认页面。展现收款人 Robert Dawson 的头像、支付金额 $50.00、可留空的 Note 备注区，以及付款用卡选择和 \"Pay now\" 按钮。\n6. **`06_Receipt`** (Node ID: `10:223`) — 电子收据。包含详尽的数据流水（Amount $40.00、Service Fee $2.82、Internet Charge $7.18、Total $50.00）和二维码，下方配有返回首页的 \"Home\" 按钮。\n\n---\n\n### 3. 原型交互网络（Prototype Wired）\n所有按钮与跳转已利用 Figma 的 Interaction 机制建立起了完整的循环支付闭环：\n* `01_Get_Started` 的 **Get Started 按钮** $\\rightarrow$ 跳转至 `02_Home`\n* `02_Home` 的 **余额卡片** 或 **\"See all\"** $\\rightarrow$ 跳转至 `03_Wallet`\n* `02_Home` 的 **悬浮加号按钮 (+)** $\\rightarrow$ 跳转至 `05_Payment`\n* `03_Wallet` 的 **返回箭头** $\\rightarrow$ 返回至 `02_Home`\n* `03_Wallet` 的 **添加卡片按钮** $\\rightarrow$ 弹出半屏 `04_Add_Card` 抽屉\n* `04_Add_Card` 的 **\"Add new card\"** 或 **\"关闭图标\"** $\\rightarrow$ 返回 `03_Wallet`\n* `05_Payment` 的 **\"Cancel\"** $\\rightarrow$ 取消并返回 `02_Home`\n* `05_Payment` 的 **\"Pay now\"** $\\rightarrow$ 支付并跳转至 `06_Receipt`\n* `06_Receipt` 的 **\"Home\" 按钮** $\\rightarrow$ 重置状态返回至 `02_Home`\n\n---\n\n### 4. 视觉规范落实\n* **字体**: 全局使用了指定的 `Inter` 字体（Regular, Medium, Semi Bold, Bold），排版比例优雅清晰。\n* **色彩**: 融入了品牌蓝色 `#007AFF` 并在不同的卡片、背景和高亮元素（如绿色 `+$50.00`）上保证了一致的色彩系统。\n* **素材复用**: 深度复用了 `04 · Media` 中的高保真商家图标（Apple, Nike, Uber）、银行卡纹理、插画、卡组织标志（Visa, Mastercard）以及人物头像等，确保交付质量高度对齐高水准的 iOS 移动端体验。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37386,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a4452011-3230-4699-83de-3ef384270e2a","uuid":"42718bae-d258-46c1-a243-b214a3fe1520","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:15:18.214Z"}
